   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Bright clean daylight: median ~130 with deep blacks (p1 ~3) and bright whites (p99 ~240), warm shadows (38,27,24), warm highlights (219,214,204), reds+oranges 70% of colour mass, saturation 0.32. Best for: Sunny street candids, humour and coincidence frames, bright city walks, daytime guest moments, pre-wedding city shoots. Clean and bright.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
